./governance/audits/2026-08-21-toolchain/F-tokens.md:38:| PostToolUse | Bash | `verification-rot-check.py` | 60s | **2x** (identical command, once via explicit `/opt/homebrew/bin/python3 "…"`, once via bare `${HOME}/.claude/hooks/….py`) |
./governance/audits/2026-08-21-toolchain/F-tokens.md:43:**This is a real bug, not a design choice** — both registrations are byte-identical except for how python3 is invoked. Every `Bash` tool call runs `verification-rot-check.py` twice; every `Stop` runs `check-graph-sync.py` twice. Confirmed via `python3 -m json.tool` dump of the actual settings.json hooks block.
./governance/audits/2026-08-21-toolchain/F-tokens.md:105:   `verification-rot-check.py` (PostToolUse/Bash, 60s) and `check-graph-sync.py` (Stop, 10s) are each registered twice with byte-identical commands (only the python3-invocation style differs). This doubles process-spawn overhead on *every* Bash call and *every* Stop event for the whole session, and — worse — doubles real Sonnet API spend on every qualifying `git commit` (up to 10 calls instead of 5). **Fix**: delete one entry per event in settings.json. Config-only change. Expected saving: ~50% of hook-triggered LLM spend on commits, ~50% of hook process-spawn overhead session-wide. Risk: none — it's a pure duplicate, not two different checks.
./docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Verification/2026-06-26_lumos-deinit_跨平台.md:39:`python3 scripts/test_lumos.py`(homemade check() 框架,hermetic:temp root + git init + temp HOME)。Windows 端 fetch 驗證分支後同指令跑,互動路徑用 expect 驅真 tty。
./docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Verification/2026-08-01_slim-終審三缺陷修復.md:15:  TEST:①新增 `t_slim_ps1_write_error_noterminating_under_stop_preference`(靜態結構檢查:三支 .ps1 仍設 `$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"`、6 處 `Write-Error` 本行皆帶 `-ErrorAction Continue`/`SilentlyContinue`/`Ignore`、Stop 賦值出現在所有 Write-Error 之前)②新增 `t_slim_uninstall_windows_orphan_cmd_shim_removed`(孤兒 lumos.cmd 場景,真實裝一次、手動只刪 lumos,斷言不帶 --force 也能清掉,因為 shim 內容比對得上樣板)+ `t_slim_uninstall_windows_orphan_cmd_shim_foreign_content_needs_force`(對稱驗證:內容不符樣板時 rc1 拒絕、--force 才移除,證明修法不是無腦清空)。`python3 scripts/test_lumos.py -k slim` 317 checks 全綠。紅→綠實測:①用 mutant 拿掉某一處 `-ErrorAction Continue` 重跑該測試,對應那條「本行有明確非終止 -ErrorAction 覆寫」斷言確實翻紅(mutant 立即還原,未進 commit)②`git stash push -- slim/uninstall.py` 還原成本次修復前的舊版,重跑 `-k orphan_cmd_shim`,`t_slim_uninstall_windows_orphan_cmd_shim_removed`(孤兒 lumos.cmd 確實被清掉)與 `t_slim_uninstall_windows_orphan_cmd_shim_foreign_content_needs_force`(--force 後檔案確實被移除)兩條核心斷言確實翻紅(舊版對孤兒現場整段不處理,`--force` 也救不了),`git stash pop` 還原後重跑轉綠,非稻草人。
./docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Verification/2026-08-01_slim-終審三缺陷修復.md:39:**②** `uninstall.py` 的 `~/.local/bin/lumos.cmd` 處理邏輯移出 `~/.local/bin/lumos` 的 if 區塊,改成獨立的「①b」區塊(僅 `IS_WIN`),與①各自獨立判斷、各自執行、互不阻擋——呼應本專案 Task 10 已定的「卸載各步互不阻擋」原則。安全判斷依據:shim 沒有 manifest 雜湊可比對(shim 內容是固定樣板、跟安裝位置無關,拿它比對沒有鑑別力),改用「內容是否符合 `install.py` `_install_cli()` 產生的固定樣板」(`SHIM_TEXT_RE = r'\A@echo off\r\n(?:python3|python) "%~dp0lumos" %\*\r\n\Z'`)當基準:符合視為本包裝的 shim,可安全移除(不需要 `--force`);不符合當成使用者自己的東西,拒絕移除(要砍就 `--force`)。★踩到的一個實作坑★:第一版用 `dst_shim.read_text(encoding="utf-8")` 讀取內容比對,但 `Path.read_text()` 預設 universal-newline 轉譯,會把 shim 內容裡的 `\r\n` 正規化成 `\n`,即使檔案位元組完全沒被動過,也讓比對 `\r\n` 的 `SHIM_TEXT_RE` 永遠比不到——新測試第一輪就抓到這個(`t_slim_uninstall_windows_orphan_cmd_shim_removed` 翻紅),改成 `read_bytes().decode("utf-8")` 修正。這正是 `t_slim_install_windows_collision_detects_orphan_cmd_shim` docstring 已經點過一次的同一個坑,在讀取端的鏡像版本。
./docs/lumos-toolchain-knowledge/Verification/2026-08-01_slim-終審三缺陷修復.md:50:4. 紅→綠實測(②,非稻草人):`git stash push -- slim/uninstall.py` 還原成本次修復前的舊版(新測試已寫好、code 未改),重跑 `python3 scripts/test_lumos.py -k orphan_cmd_shim`——15 checks 中 3 個翻紅:「★孤兒 lumos.cmd 確實被清掉(不是永遠殘留)★」(舊版對孤兒現場整段不處理,連印都不印)、「★內容不符本包樣板 → rc1(安全性跳過,非硬錯誤)★」(舊版永遠 rc0,不會主動拒絕)、「--force 後檔案確實被移除」(舊版 `--force` 分支同樣巢狀在 dst_script 的 if 裡,救不了孤兒殘留)。`git stash pop` 還原後重跑,15 checks 全綠。
